[Stage: build] WebPortal: npm install
[Stage: build] AuthGateway: mvn compile
[Stage: test] CustomerService: mvn test
[Stage: test] AnalyticsEngine: python3 -m unittest
[Stage: deploy] WebPortal -> web-tier
[Stage: deploy] AuthGateway -> edge-api
[Stage: deploy] NotificationEngine -> messaging-queue
[Stage: deploy] AnalyticsEngine -> analytics-tier
[Stage: deploy] AdminConsole -> admin-tier
